# libFuzzer dictionary for the ep9 front-end targets (frontend_compile, function_ctor,
# eval_context). Part 1 has a token for every nesting form of crates/ep9_frontend/src/forms.rs:
# the 13 M0 exit item 7 forms, the 7 M1 exit item 8 forms and the other recursive productions
# (G6, docs/plan/02-architecture.md: deep nesting gives SyntaxError or RangeError, never an
# abort). Repeating one token builds the deep form. Part 2 is general JavaScript.

